<title>BELGIUM: EU to study Boeing technology access.</title>
<headline>EU to study Boeing technology access.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Wednesday that among the issues it would be studying regarding the proposed merger of Boeing Co and McDonnell Douglas Corp were the new company's access to defence and space technology and possible increased bargaining power with equipment suppliers.</p>
<p>&quot;The Commission will...need to investigate to what extent the large increase in Boeing's defence and space business could strengthen its market position in commercial aircraft, for example in terms of overall financial resources, greater access to technology developed in the defence and space sector, and increased bargaining power vis-a-vis equipment suppliers,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
